    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omulango kwaMusa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Musa yali niyaayanga ebiayo biaYetsero nyakhufialanyene, omwisaaliisi waMidiani; niyeemilila ebiayobie nabiyila injelekha weshitsiimi niyoola khushikulu shiaNyasaye, eHorebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika waNyasaye namuloleshela mulumemo Iwomulilo, hakari mushitsakha shindi; nahenga, ne lola, eshitsakha shiali nishiyiitsanga, ne omulilo shikwashisambanga eshitsakha eshio ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nasunga ari Engotole bulaano, endole likhuwa lino likhongo, elichila omulilo nikurasambanga eshitsakha shino ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa OMWAMI yalola nakotola mbu atsie okhulola, Nyasaye namulanga hakari mushitsakha, mbu Musa, Musa! Naye nafuchila mbu Endiho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboola mbu Orasita ahambi hano tawe; wifwalule ebilaaro mubilenjebio, okhuba liloba elia osinjiilekhwo nihabundu hobutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi naboola mbu Isie nisie Nyasaye wabakuukabo, Nyasaye waAburahamu, Nyasaye waIsaka, khandi Nyasaye waYakobo. Musa niyeebisa obweni; shichila yaria okhumuhenga Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nasunga mbu Toto mwene, ndaluutsinji okhumiinwa khwabandu banje abali eMisiri, khandi embuliile amalilo kabwe khulwa abasinjilili babwe; okhuba ndamanya okhutsuunwa khwabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne enzishile okhubahabina mumukhono kwabaMisiri, nokhubatikulusia okhurula mushibala eshio, okhuula mushibala eshilayi khandi eshibambalifu, okhuula mushibala eshiitsuulemwo amabeele nende obuushi; okhuula habundu wabaKanaani, nabaHiti, nabaAmori, nabaPerizi, nabaHiti, nende abaYebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, lola amalilo kabaana baIsiraeli kanzuliile; khandi ndaluutsi obumiini bwabaMisiri shinga olwa babamiinanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano yitsa, ekhurume ewaFarao, mbu orusie abandu banje, abaana baIsiraeli, muMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa namusunjila Nyasaye ari Nasi nisie wina, owakhatsiila Farao, kata mbu erusie abaana baIsiraeli muMisiri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye naboola mbu Shindalachweya okhubeetsanga ninawe halala tawe; khandi lino lilakhubeela eshilolelo mbu nisie oukhurumile; mbu olwa oliba norusiye abandu abo muMisiri, mulimukhalabanila Nyasaye khushikulu shino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa namusunjila Nyasaye ari Ne olwa ndakhabatsiile abaana baIsiraeli, nimbasunjila ndi Nyasaye wabakuuka beenywe yarumile khwinywe; nabo olwa bakhareebe bari Eliiralie niye wina? Kho ndakhabakalusie endie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Nyasaye namuboolela Musa mbu ISIE NISIE OULI ISIE; nasunga mbu Obasunjile abaana baIsiraeli ori nanwa, mbu ISIE NISIE yarumile khwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye nameeta namuboolela Musa ari Wakhaboolele abaana baIsiraeli ori nanwa, mbu OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuuka beenywe, Nyasaye waAburahamu, Nyasaye waIsaka, khandi Nyasaye waYakobo, yarumile khwinywe; lino nilio eliira lianje obushia nobushia, khandi lino nilio eshiitsulilo shianje okhuula khubisoni nebisoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsia, okhung'aasie abakofu baIsiraeli halala, obaboolele mbu OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuuka beenywe, Nyasaye waAburahamu, khandi waIsaka, khandi waYakobo, yandolesheele, nasunga mbu Shinjweyile okhumukoonya ta, nindola aka mukholelungwa eMisiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimuboolela mbu Ndalamutikulusia nimurusia mukhumiinwa khweMisiri, nimuusia mushibala shiabaKanaani, nabaHiti, nabaAmori, nabaPerizi, nabaHiwi, nende abaYebusi, okhuula khushibala eshiitsuulemwo amabeele nende obuushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balahulila okhuboolakhwo; mana mulatsia, iwe nende abakofu baIsiraeli, ewomuruchi waMisiri, mumusunjile mbu OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabaHeburania, abukaane nineefu; kho balaano khukhusaaya ofuchiilile khutsie oluchendo lwetsindaalo tsitaru mushitsiimi, khumumalile OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe emisango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi emanyile mbu omuruchi waMisiri shialamuheelesia omunwa okhutsia nahatuutu ta, kata khulwa omukhono kwamaani tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalanyiila omukhono kwanje, nirootsa Misiri nende ebiamakana bianje ebia enzitsa okhukhola mukari washio; nolunyuma lwa ebio alamulekhuula mutsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalachila abandu bano nibakoosibwa nabaMisiri; ne olwa mutsia, shimulatsia butswa tawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula buli mukhasi alasaba omumenyaniwe, khandi nende oumenyanga munzuye, ebimili bieifeetsa, nende ebimili bieitsahaabu, nende ebiifwalo; ne mulabifwala abaana beenywe abasiani, nende abaana beenywe abakhaana; nindio mulabayaaya abaMisiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
